                "CHALLENGE_COMPONENTID": "6616",
                "GARMENTID": "1010",
                "LABLE": "<i class='fa fa-cubes' aria-hidden='true'></i>",
                "TOPTEXT": "Naughty or nice, here's a stocking for anyone on your list. <br><br>Knit in any yarn on any machine, the short row toes and heel construction provides a canvas for your creativity. <br><br>Choose mini, small, standard and jumbo sizes.<br><br>2 variations are offered: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Basic Stocking has fewer seams</li><br>\r\n<li>Mix 'n Match version allows for a different stitch pattern to be worked on the top and bottom of the foot. Plus the leg seam offers more support for filled stocking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<em>NOTE: The mini size should be worked on a standard gauge machine<</em>"
              },
