              "html": "<a href=\"/classrooms/169/fairisle-stranded-knitting\">\r\n\t<img src=\"/path/images/126/punchcard_classroom_thumb.jpg\">\r\n</a><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6623,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Classroom: Punchcards",
          "slug": "classroom-punchcards",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4373,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\nOne of the many advantages of machine knitting is the ability to quickly and easily knit in pattern.<br>Textured stitch patterns, multi-color patterns can all be quickly produced with the help of automatic patterning devices. <b>Using a punchcard or electronics, the machine automatically selects needles for pattern knitting.</b>\r\n<br>If you've been stumped by knitting in pattern on your machine, this course will take away the fear and confusion.\r\n<br>Using fill-in-the-blanks tutorials, we'll walk you through all the settings for YOUR machine, creating a cheat-sheet that you can use again and again.\r\n<br>Once you finish the exercises <b>you will have an UNDERSTANDING of what is going on with all the levers and buttons</b> and you will be confident to sit down and work the stitch pattern of your choice.<br><div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/challenge/72/course/automatic-stitch-patterning\"><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/91/v2/72/automatic_patterning_thumb.png\"></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6613,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "New to Automatic Patterning?",
          "slug": "new-to-automatic-patterning",
          "order": 4,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4367,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>Stitch Inspiration from Knit it Now</h3>\r\nOver 50 Christmas-themed stitch patterns that include DAK Stitch Designer files, printable patterns and printable punchcard patterns (for 24 stitch repeat designs)<br>Mix 'n Match these designs for your stocking<br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/knit/stitchlibrary/15/christmas\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/91/thumb_300.jpg\"></a><br><center></center>\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/knit/stitchlibrary/19/christmas\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/91/thumb2_300.jpg\"></a><br><center></center>\r\n\t\r\n\t<a href=\"/knit/stitchlibrary/20/christmas\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/91/thumb3_300.jpg\"></a><br><center></center>\r\n\t\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6618,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\nhr.style13 {\r\nheight: 10px;\r\nborder: 0;\r\nbox-shadow: 0 10px 10px -10px #8c8b8b inset;\r\n}\r\n\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n<br>\r\n<h3><i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o fa-2x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Use full-scale graph paper to plan your design</h3><br>\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6620,
              "order": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "migrationPending",
